config SAMPLE_KUNIT_EXAMPLE_TEST
	tristate "KUnit test for kunit_example" if !KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	depends on SAMPLE_KUNIT_EXAMPLE && KUNIT
	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	help
	  This builds unit tests for the kunit_example module.
	  It demonstrates how to mock internal functions using static stubs.
	  The tests cover both real and mocked implementations of the internal
	  logic via the public API.

	  If unsure, say N.
